<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Donate | SkillsUSA</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Spectral:wght@400;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/donate.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('header') %>
    <main>
      <section class="hero hero-donate">
        <div class="hero-media" role="img" aria-label="Donate to SkillsUSA"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>Donate to SkillsUSA</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">Support the next generation of skilled professionals</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="donate-intro">
        <div class="intro-content">
          <h2>Make a Difference</h2>
          <p>
            Without the support of our partners, SkillsUSA's vital mission of empowering students to
            become skilled professionals, career-ready leaders and responsible community members
            could never be accomplished. Learn more about the why's and how's of supporting SkillsUSA,
            and help us shape a future we can all be proud of: a future set in skills.
          </p>
          <p>
            Your donation directly supports student competitions, training programs, and leadership
            development opportunities that prepare the next generation for successful careers.
            Your support empowers students to become skilled professionals, leaders, and engaged
            community members. Donate today to help shape the future of our students and our industry.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <main class="contact-container">
      <div class="contact-intro">
        <h2>Donate Today</h2>
        <p>Use the form below to contact us about donations. We'll respond as soon as possible.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-container">
        <form class="contact-form" method="POST" action="/donate">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="name">Full Name *</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email Address *</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Message *</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="form-button">Send Message</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
